flowchart TD
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities<br/>Each integer in {1-10}<br/>Sum capacities less or equal 30"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>f1 average WIP minimize<br/>f2 throughput maximize implemented as negated objective"]
NSGA2Runner["**NSGA2 Runner**<br/>Attributes pop_size n_gen sampling crossover mutation algorithm<br/>Methods run_nsga2_optimization"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes n_var n_obj xl xu n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Methods _evaluate elementwise evaluation disabled"]
ParallelPool["**Parallel Pool**<br/>Multiprocessing Pool spawn processes<br/>Distributes simulation tasks across cores"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>Functions evaluate_single_individual run_simulation_for_caps<br/>Handles seeds replications and penalization for infeasible solutions"]
Simulation["**Production Simulation**<br/>Function production_line_run orchestrates env and processes<br/>Returns throughput mean WIP and energy per part metrics"]
Machine["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes name mean_time availability mttr energy_idle energy_work calendar_event resource energy last_state_change idle up<br/>Methods breakdown_process add_energy set_state process_part _mtbf"]
BufferClass["**Buffer Class**<br/>Attributes name capacity process_time calendar_event store<br/>Methods put get with calendar aware processing"]
Exporter["**Exporter**<br/>Function export_history_to_csv<br/>Writes feasible solutions from every generation to CSV results file"]

DecisionVars --> BufferProblem
Objectives --> BufferProblem
NSGA2Runner --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> ParallelPool
ParallelPool --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> Simulation
Simulation --> Machine
Simulation --> BufferClass
Simulation --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> NSGA2Runner
NSGA2Runner --> Exporter
Exporter --> NSGA2Runner